{"id":"d754a154b50a9533","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-delta0-formula.md","title":"$\\Delta 0$ Formula (Bounded Formula)","display":"df-delta0-formula — $\\Delta_0$ Formula (Bounded Formula)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-delta0-formula","aliases":["92-df-delta0-formula"],"display":"df-delta0-formula — $\\Delta_0$ Formula (Bounded Formula)","depends_on":["[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-atomic-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"],"source":"第 IV 章 pp. 41–42（PDF 58–59）","source_status":"原书有界概念的本地宽文法"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-delta0-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-delta0-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-delta0-formula — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> Formula (Bounded Formula)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ed78135d2cc20c6\" href=\"?note=6ed78135d2cc20c6\" title=\"92-df-bounded-quantifier\">92-df-bounded-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc02207ec79f9d66\" href=\"?note=dc02207ec79f9d66\" title=\"92-df-atomic-formula\">92-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 pp. 41–42（PDF 58–59）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书有界概念的本地宽文法"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\)</span> (atomic-formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dc02207ec79f9d66\" href=\"?note=dc02207ec79f9d66\" title=\"92-df-atomic-formula\">92-df-atomic-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (term set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (definition-target bounded-formula class)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\Delta_0^G\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\ \\Bigm|\\ {}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\subseteq D\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;\\bigl((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\n\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\Bigl(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}((\\forall x&lt;t)\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\exists x&lt;t)\\varphi\\in D)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\Delta_0^G\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\ \\Bigm|\\ {}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\subseteq D\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;\\bigl((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\n\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\Bigl(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}((\\forall x&lt;t)\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\exists x&lt;t)\\varphi\\in D)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>公式：所有量词都是有界的</li>\n<li>也称<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span>公式或有界公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>公式的真值在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>中可判定</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0 = \\Sigma_0 = \\Pi_0\">\\(\\Delta_0 = \\Sigma_0 = \\Pi_0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>归纳：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span>系统</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>公式在有界算术中是核心概念</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall x&lt;S(n))\\,\\neg(S(x)=0)\">\\((\\forall x&lt;S(n))\\,\\neg(S(x)=0)\\)</span>（其中界项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(n)\">\\(S(n)\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书 Σ₀ 只准变量/数码作规范原子参数，界也只准数码或不同变量。本地 Δ₀ 允许任意无指数复合项和界项，因此“也称 Σ₀”指通常层级惯例，不表示原书两个字符串集合相同；精确原书文法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9a375244351119bb\" href=\"?note=9a375244351119bb\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes\">92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-bounded-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"dc02207ec79f9d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"dc02207ec79f9d66","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_G$ (atomic-formula set, see [[92-df-atomic-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variable-symbol set, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term set, see [[92-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes","status":"resolved","id":"9a375244351119bb","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书 Σ₀ 只准变量/数码作规范原子参数，界也只准数码或不同变量。本地 Δ₀ 允许任意无指数复合项和界项，因此“也称 Σ₀”指通常层级惯例，不表示原书两个字符串集合相同；精确原书文法见 [[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\Delta_0^G\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\ \\Bigm|\\ {}&\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\subseteq D\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in D)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in D\\;\\bigl((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in D\n\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\n\\forall\\varphi\\in D\\;\\Bigl(x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_G(t)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}((\\forall x<t)\\varphi\\in D\\land(\\exists x<t)\\varphi\\in D)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0 = \\Sigma_0 = \\Pi_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"(\\forall x<S(n))\\,\\neg(S(x)=0)","display":false},{"tex":"S(n)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":2227,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^G$ (bounded-formula class, see [[92-df-delta0-formula]])"},{"id":"ea47eabc51d9439c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^G$ (bounded-formula class, see [[92-df-delta0-formula]])"},{"id":"c4f0c170aff0bb4a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^G,\\Sigma_1^G,\\Pi_1^G$ (arithmetic-hierarchy classes, see [[92-df-delta0-formula]], [[92-df-sigma1-formula]], [[92-df-pi1-formula]])"},{"id":"56f4ef08abc6d228","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"235651614fd28cce","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cf0f2611d5bc4db4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"随后沿前一定理的定理集包含传递到其它四个系统。此处 Σ₀ 是原书的规范化类；本地任意嵌套项的 Δ₀ 分类仍见 [[92-df-delta0-formula]]，未未经证明把两个句法集合当成同一集合。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-delta0-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["6ed78135d2cc20c6","5a1bd470754681a7","dc02207ec79f9d66","d666a3e3ee6c8148","4ef6f65f207e8439","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","9a375244351119bb"]}